odotengine/godot/pulls/118008","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118008","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118008.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118008.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-06T18:07:07Z"},"body":"Array properties have been using the default name split ratio of 0.5, resulting in lots of wasted space.\r\n<img width=\"301\" height=\"375\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c4d1eb16-6f8b-47c4-ab63-58fd368add77\" />\r\nThe name is only a number, so it does not need that much space.\r\n\r\nI experimented with decreasing the ratio, but it just does not make sense if the size of the names is always the same, so instead I introduced a fixed size for the name part.\r\n<img width=\"282\" height=\"360\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d5a2f235-0a39-424a-ae06-147efabf6d23\" />\r\nMuch more usable.\r\n\r\n*Bugsquad edit:*\r\n- Implements and closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/5457.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"ht